   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <gap reason="published"/>
                    <p>
                        <seg type="published" function="context">
                            <quote>il y a une semaine en ce sens.</quote>
                            <bibl>
                                <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">LI</name> 423</bibl>
                        </seg> Donc <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">qu’on le paie</seg> et qu’il se retire officiellement de l’affaire. </p>
                    <p>
                        <seg type="published" function="context">
                            <quote>J’ai prié M. Zumsteg</quote>
                            <bibl>
                                <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">LI</name> 423</bibl>
                        </seg>
                    </p>
                    <gap reason="published"/>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <p>Let’s pay him then and let him withdraw officially from the matter.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">Although not apparent from the published letter, JJ’s slightly disdainful tone indicates his dissatisfaction with the lawyer Haldenwang.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
